<http://data.silknow.org/object/fdbdeefd-0495-33a4-adfe-dc72dd8f0a50>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Two pieces.  Brocaded in polychrome silks on a compound satin ground.  (b) has a wide satin stripe in the center shading from white through yellow to tan, with scattered small leaf motifs.  On either side, a leafy floral vine brocaded on a ribbed silk ground.  (a) brocaded with a symmetrical leafy floral vine, with a narrow tan satin stripe at each edge.  (b) has selvedge on one side of six cords, the other side turned in and basted.  Soiled, worn, holes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/878a0dce-0367-3b35-be01-f86ae2e7cad2> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Two pieces.  Brocaded in polychrome silks on a compound satin ground.  (b) has a wide satin stripe in the center shading from white through yellow to tan, with scattered small leaf motifs.  On either side, a leafy floral vine brocaded on a ribbed silk ground.  (a) brocaded with a symmetrical leafy floral vine, with a narrow tan satin stripe at each edge.  (b) has selvedge on one side of six cords, the other side turned in and basted.  Soiled, worn, holes."@en ;
